        <profileDesc>
            <abstract xml:lang="de"><p resp="#regest">Bürgermeister und Rat zu Rorschach bitten Bürgermeister und Rat zu St. Gallen, in der Stadt nachforschen zu lassen, ob der in Rorschach festgenommene Metzger Melchior Pfister, der einen St. Galler Kaufmann um 150 Florin bestohlen haben soll, dort weitere Diebstähle begangen hat. Sie bitten um eine schriftliche Antwort, um den Gefangenen freizulassen oder zu verurteilen.</p></abstract>
            <abstract xml:lang="en" resp="#mt"><p>Burgomaster and Council of Rorschach ask Burgomaster and Council of St. Gallen to have it investigated in the city whether the butcher Melchior Pfister, who was arrested in Rorschach and is supposed to have stolen 150 florins from a merchant of St. Gallen, committed further thefts there. They ask for a written answer in order to release the prisoner or to convict him.</p></abstract>
